photo-selector-linux (0.2.0-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * The app is now called Blitzlens.
  * New application id app.alpatix.Blitzlens: the app appears as a new
    launcher entry, the old launcher entry is removed on upgrade.
  * New icon, including a symbolic variant and dedicated 16 and 24 pixel sizes.
  * Selection and focus colours follow the system accent colour.
  * Settings in ~/.config/photo-selector-linux/ are kept.
  * Safer Move, Copy, Trash and Undo; readable Move button; EXIF with newer
    Pillow; reproducible package.

 -- Alexander Patz <alexpp90@users.noreply.github.com>  Thu, 22 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000

photo-selector-linux (0.1.0-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Initial release for Debian 13 (Trixie).
  * Native GNOME Libadwaita photograph culling and selection suite.
  * Vectorized Laplacian focus scoring with MAD noise floor compensation.
  * Transactional file operations (Move, Copy, Trash) with copy-undo safety.
  * Multi-view canvas: 1-Up, 2-Up, and 3-Up Focus Mode with BoundarySlotPane.
  * Zero-latency keyboard router with root-level capture and modifier masking.

 -- Alexander Patz <alexpp90@users.noreply.github.com>  Sat, 10 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
